TOOL CAVEAT (new, recorded so the next measure does not re-derive it): closure_cost.py
searches only .lake/packages, so `closure_cost.py Bonnifaci.M6` reports "SOURCE: ABSENT on
this pin". The tool can only measure *dependency* modules, not this project's own; the
intra-project cost must be read from the build itself (10s for a new module, ~2s for the
root aggregate).

